(window.__LORE=window.__LORE||{}).messenger={"t": 1793159667237, "me": "Mina", "auto": true, "ppl": [{"id": "sw", "n": "Kaelen ", "s": "off", "pm": "Si Wong Bureau", "h": [["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:02", "mina. quick. do you have a minute"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:02", "i have two"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:03", "i am at the northeast camp. the foreman says the rigs were fine on thursday and not fine on friday. i have no idea what happened between"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:04", "ask him for the shift logs"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:04", "he looked at me like i asked for his bank card"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:05", "that is a yes. he has them"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:05", "how do you know that"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:06", "a man who has nothing to hide shrugs. a man who has something looks at you like that"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:06", "you are scary"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 14:07", "i am just observant"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 09:30", "the sand in the generators. it is a different grain than the local sand. coarser. red"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 09:31", "so someone brought it"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 09:31", "someone brought it. from the old earth empire depots near the salt flats"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 09:32", "you have a sample"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 09:32", "in a tea tin. do not tell my wife"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 09:33", "your wife will find out from the invoice for the tea tin"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 09:33", "she reads invoices too. why is everyone like this"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 09:34", "because invoices do not lie as often"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 06:50", "the wind is awful. i have sand in places i did not know existed"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 06:51", "please do not describe those places"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 06:51", "i will keep it clean. the story is that the guards stopped coming at night. the company cut the night patrol"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 06:52", "to save money"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 06:52", "to save money. which is why it is a great week to be a saboteur"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 06:53", "write that down. exactly like that. it is the lede"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 06:53", "i hate that you are right"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 07:52", "mina, just got the morning wire from the outposts. the drilling camps up in the northeast si wong sector got hit again last night. third time this year and the companies are bleeding money over it."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 07:55", "again? geez. what did they take this time? did they hijack the crude shipments or just strip the copper wiring again?"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 08:01", "that's the thing, they didn't take anything of actual value. they just rolled in, severed the main pressure valves on four of the active rigs, and dumped sand into the generators. left a massive message painted across the primary derrick. it read: &quot;pay the toll or the empire reclaims its sand.&quot; the site foremen are absolutely losing it right now."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 08:03", "&quot;the empire&quot; huh. are we assuming it's the exact same kuvira loyalist cell from the spring sabotage? i thought the restored kingdom regulars flushed them out of the basin months ago."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 08:06", "they definitely didn't flush them all out. it's almost certainly the same crew. the tracks left in the sand are a perfect match for the old earth empire mechanized treads we saw back in april, and they used that same thick green smoke to cover their retreat. they are still out here operating like it's 176 ag and the great uniter is still calling the shots.   "], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:51", "it's been fourteen years since the empire fell on victory day. you'd think they would have run out of spare parts for those old mechs by now. how are the local authorities responding?"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:51", "the local magistrates are panicking because the oil consortiums are threatening to pull their private security out if the military doesn't step in. these loyalists know the desert better than the regular army does. they strike fast, break the infrastructure, and vanish into the dunes before anyone can even bend a rock at them. they're trying to cripple the supply chain."], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:51", "i need to run this past the editor. if the oil supply from the si wong fields drops again, it's going to spike fuel prices in the capital by next week. do you have any visual evidence i can pitch for the front page?"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:51", "yeah, i drove out there at dawn and took a roll of photographs of the sabotage and the painted message. problem is my camera battery completely died in the desert cold before i could process them. i'll have the prints developed and put them on the morning wire to your office tomorrow."], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:52", "perfect. write up a draft on the political angle too. keep your head down out there, kaelen. those imperial holdouts aren't playing around."]], "r": ["still out here. the wind keeps eating my notes", "guards say they want a patrol. company says no budget lol", "ok brb getting a ride back to camp", "foreman wont say the bandits name on record. classic"], "ar": true, "om": ""}, {"id": "kor", "n": "Kanoikya", "s": "off", "pm": "Insane Person I guess", "h": [["in", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:40", "how is republic city"], ["out", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:41", "wet. everyone has a boat"], ["in", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:41", "did you eat the dumplings i told you about"], ["out", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:42", "the ones near the bridge"], ["in", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:42", "YES"], ["out", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:43", "they were fine"], ["in", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:43", "FINE"], ["out", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:44", "very good. i ate twelve"], ["in", "8 Oct 190 AG, 23:44", "that is the right number"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 09:14", "so wtf actually happened to kuvira? it’s been like 9 years and nobody talks about the details. lol bc the earth state censors still scrub half the forums. we just know she officially died on September 4, 181 AG."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 09:14", "yeah, out in the Western Agricultural Sector of the Outer wall in Ba sing Se....  So what's your crazy theory this time?"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 09:15", "it's not a theory, it's what happened. Korra killed her fair and square."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 09:18", "bs. korra wouldn't just execute someone."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 09:21", "dude, she went batshit insane. you think she was just going to arrest her after everything? Korra went full Avatar State. she pulled the exact same move Aang did to Ozai at Qinglan Port."], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:38", "SLR, you're telling me korra just vaporized her? lmao ok"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:39", "im telling you she unleashed some pure spirit energy bullshit and practically banished Kuvira from existence."], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:40", "explain the wall then??? a massive section of the Outer Wall in that sector got completely wrecked. you don't just accidentally blow out a 600-foot-tall stone wall. that was raw avatar energy missing its target or passing right through her."], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:40", "the wall damage was collateral. probably from a breaker with a fucking nuke strapped to it or IDK."], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:42", "I’ve heard totally different rumors from a guy who used to run smuggling routes through the inner ring."], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:42", "oh here we go with the darknet conspiracies..."], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:43", "no listen. it was an inside job. Kuvira’s own loyal bodyguards backstabbed her."], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:43", "her own guard? they literally called her the Great Uniter. they worshipped the ground she walked on. Like some sort a fucking messiah you know."], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:44", "people worship survival more. the war was turning into a meat grinder. her elite metalbenders saw the writing on the wall and took her out to save their own skins, then pinned the structural damage on the Avatar. \nit makes way more sense than Korra magically vaporizing a human being without leaving a body behind. the &quot;avatar state blast&quot; is the perfect cover story for a mutiny."], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:44", "nah bro. I saw leaked photos of the crater in the agrarian zone fields. a mutiny doesn't leave a crater that big.\nwhatever u say man. just remember the official story is written by the winners."], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:44", "if the winners wanted to look good they wouldn't pretend their Avatar goes nuclear on people lol. she's gone, Korra did it, end of story."], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 08:44", " brb someone at the door. "]], "r": ["NO but the guards looked so done", "ok tell me everything, i need the full story", "she did a radio interview and said the fountain \"needed a hobby\" lmaooo", "pls tell me the noodles part is real"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "desk", "n": "Taro", "s": "away", "pm": "Gaozu night desk", "h": [["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 02:10", "night desk. the foreign desk sent me three versions of the summit story"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 02:11", "which one are you running"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 02:11", "the one with the fewest adjectives"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 02:12", "that is my rule too"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 02:12", "i know. that is why i am telling you"], ["in", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:10", "wire is slow tonight. anything good"], ["out", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:11", "the grain board memo. i am still cleaning the numbers"], ["in", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:11", "how long"], ["out", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:12", "forty minutes"], ["in", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:12", "it is eleven"], ["out", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:13", "it will be done by midnight"], ["in", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:13", "you said forty"], ["out", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:14", "i said forty minutes. it is eleven ten. by eleven fifty"], ["in", "13 Oct 190 AG, 23:14", "do not make me do arithmetic. i am tired"], ["in", "17 Oct 190 AG, 22:02", "hey the chief hates the headline on your oil piece"], ["out", "17 Oct 190 AG, 22:03", "why"], ["in", "17 Oct 190 AG, 22:03", "she says it makes the saboteurs sound romantic"], ["out", "17 Oct 190 AG, 22:04", "then change it. i do not care about headlines. i care about the third paragraph"], ["in", "17 Oct 190 AG, 22:04", "you are the only writer who says that"], ["out", "17 Oct 190 AG, 22:05", "everyone says it. they just dont mean it"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:40", "gonna kill the last paragraph. too long for the column"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:41", "which one"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:41", "the one with the clerks name"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:42", "it does not have a name"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:42", "ok then it is the one about the clerk's nerves"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:43", "that one is the point"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:43", "i know. it is also eighty words"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:44", "cut the second sentence and keep the last"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 23:45", "done. you are terrifyingly efficient"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:30", "front page layout is officially set for the morning edition. the si wong oil sabotage is taking the lead headline. we had to push the piece on korra to page 3 because the president's press secretary will absolutely not stop calling the publisher's office to complain about her statement."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:33", "are they seriously still whining about the avatar? unbelievable. wait, are we definitively running the desert drills as the absolute lead? or are we swapping the layout if the senate committee throws a fit about the energy panic?"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:35", "definitely the drills. an armed insurgency hitting the fuel supply is way bigger news than political posturing. but the legal team for the si wong oil consortium is begging us to wait for their formal statement before we run it, so we are holding the final print run until 22:00.   "], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:36", "fine, but tell legal we aren't watering down kaelen's report from the desert. the loyalists literally painted &quot;pay the toll or the empire reclaims its sand&quot; right on the machinery. we are printing that exact quote."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:38", "fine, but tell legal we aren't watering down kaelen's report from the desert. the loyalists literally painted &quot;pay the toll or the empire reclaims its sand&quot; right on the machinery. we are printing that exact quote."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:40", "good catch. fixing the photo caption right now. updating it to the northeast si wong sector and crediting kaelen for the wire photography."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:45", "alright, fixed and sent back to your terminal for final approval. by the way, to make room for the oil consortium's statement, we had to bump the earth kingdom grain price hike piece all the way to the back section."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:48", "honestly, that's fair. nobody in republic city cares about the price of imported wheat tonight when kuvira loyalists are blowing up pressure valves and threatening the entire gas supply. i'm reviewing the caption fix now. standby."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:55", "caption looks solid now, taro. i approved the final sign-off on page one."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 17:58", "perfect. plates are heading down to the press room soon as the legal team clears that oil statement. grab some coffee, it’s going to be a long night waiting for those final edits."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 18:00", "way ahead of you. i'm on my third cup already. let me know the second the 22:00 deadline passes and the presses start rolling."]], "r": ["away from my desk, editing till the press run", "give me ten minutes, reading the wire now", "killed the last paragraph. too long for the column"], "ar": true, "om": ""}, {"id": "rin", "n": "Rin", "s": "on", "pm": "My little sister", "h": [["in", "1 Oct 190 AG, 22:00", "is the city big"], ["out", "1 Oct 190 AG, 22:01", "the hotel looks out on a bridge and a lot of boats"], ["in", "1 Oct 190 AG, 22:01", "picture"], ["out", "1 Oct 190 AG, 22:02", "(sends a photo of a bridge)"], ["in", "1 Oct 190 AG, 22:03", "you didnt send a boat"], ["out", "1 Oct 190 AG, 22:03", "there are too many boats"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 21:30", "are the rich men fighting now"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 21:31", "some of them"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 21:31", "will bread get dear"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 21:32", "maybe a little. i will tell you"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 21:32", "ok. ttyl"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:12", "you didnt call sunday"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:13", "i know. im sorry. the piece got held"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:13", "mom said you looked thin on the video"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:14", "mom says that about everyone"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:14", "she says it about you most"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:15", "eating. i promise. there is a noodle place under the office"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:16", "ok. i got the scholarship letter"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:16", "WHAT"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:16", "rin"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:17", "why did you not lead with that"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:17", "you were being a reporter at me"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:18", "fair. read it to me"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:19", "\"the committee is pleased to offer\". thats all i read before i screamed"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:19", "good. thats the right amount"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:20", "you carried me out of a building and now im going to be a nurse. weird"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:21", "not weird. i will pay the first term"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:21", "you cannot"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:22", "i can and it is decided"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:22", "thanks mi"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 21:23", "k. go tell mom before she hears it from the stall"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:00", "hey mina. how are things over in republic city? are you surviving the capital desk?"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:04", "barely surviving. the national assembly is arguing over housing budgets again and my editor wants a full spread on it by tonight. how are you doing though? how is uni life treating the newest freshman?"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:05", "it's exhausting honestly. the engineering professors at the academy of gaoling assign reading like they think we don't need to sleep. but the campus is beautiful. sitting by the old coal engine monuments between classes makes it feel like i'm actually part of the republic's history."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:05", "just pace yourself. the academy has a reputation for being ruthless for a reason. have you been home to see mom and dad this week?"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:08", "yeah i took the tram back to the house for dinner last night. did you hear the bread prices in the lower districts went up AGAIN? mom almost cried at the market prices."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:29", "sorry of the late reply... \nno way. again?? they just hiked the price of basic loaves last month."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:30", "yes. mom says it’s the federal grain board manipulating the import routes from the earth kingdom. i told her it's just the <b><i>&lt;&lt;THEM>><\/i><\/b> being greedy bakers lol."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:30", "it’s probably a bit of both. the earth kingdom's agricultural output has been a complete mess ever since the second civil war. at least transportation and shipping costs haven't spiked with it.   "], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:31", "true. gas is actually super low right now. dad filled up the truck for almost nothing. everyone here is talking about that massive offshore oil deposit they just secured out in the old air temple."], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:33", "yeah, the new rigs out near the eastern air temple waters. they finally got the extraction infrastructure running and it's flooding the maritime market with cheap crude. which is honestly a lifesaver right now, considering what's happening out west in the desert."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:36", "wait what's happening out west?"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:38", "the si wong drill sites are getting hit again. bandits. well, not just bandits. kaelen from our desert bureau wired me this morning. it's the kuvira loyalists. they're sabotaging the pressure valves on the main rigs to cripple the supply chain."], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:39", "seriously? it's been nine years since the earth empire fell. don't those people have anything better to do with their lives? your news guys are gonna be so busy this week xD"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 12:40", ""], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:10", "mina are u awake"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:14", "yeah. why are you up, you have a lab at 8"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:14", "cant sleep lol. mom called. she said ur \"being quiet again\""], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:15", "im not being quiet. im working"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:16", "mina."], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:17", "got blocked by someone today. thats all. its done"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:17", "who"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:18", "dont"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:18", "the captain? the desert one with the bad jokes?"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:19", "i said dont. its handled. he gave me his reason in the end. i gave mine"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:19", "ok ok. im not asking. lol"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:20", "but u told him about zaofu?"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:21", "yeah"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:21", "all of it?"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:22", "the lists. not the rest"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:23", "ok. good. i wont either"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:30", "can i say what i remember? just once. i never told you"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:31", "go"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:34", "i remember the sky was orange before i heard anything. grandma po po was cooking and she put the spoon down very slowly like she knew"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:34", "then the glass in the kitchen went. u picked me up. u were so skinny. i remember ur elbow in my ribs"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:36", "you bit me"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:36", "LOL i did not"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:36", "you did. i still have it. left forearm"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:37", "ok maybe"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:39", "po po went back for the radio. she said \"stay with ur sister\". thats the last thing i heard her say. i didnt know until later that she meant u not me"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:41", "she meant both"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:41", "she meant YOU. u were the one who had to do it"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:42", "rin"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:43", "sorry. continuing"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:46", "we walked for ages. u made me hold ur sleeve and not let go even when i had to pee. u said if i let go you would have to find me and u didnt have time"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:47", "i was fourteen. i was terrified. it was the only rule i could think of"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:48", "it was a good rule"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:50", "the guard at the rail yard. he said \"go home, it is being handled\". i asked what was being handled and he looked at u instead of me"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:52", "and i said? i dont remember what i said"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:52", "u said \"then tell me what it is\". very calm. he went red and told us to wait in the shed"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:53", "of course i did"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:55", "u read names off the board all night. the board kept changing. u kept a list in ur head. u told me when the numbers went from 40 to 212 to 61 and u said \"thats three different bodies counting, rin. one of them is lying\""], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:57", "it was fifty-four, then two hundred and twelve, then sixty-one. i remember because mom screamed at me for being cold about it when she got there"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:58", "mom and dad were stuck on the night haul from the river docks. dad drove 9 hours to get to us"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 22:59", "i know. i told them it was fine. i was a bad liar even then"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:02", "the part i never understood. why po pos name. why did it take 19 days"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:04", "because they filed her under 'unidentified, elderly, female' at a field station in the east ward. i found it. in the city hall, in a ledger nobody had opened, on day nineteen. her ring was in a bag with a number on it"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:05", "u never said it was the ring"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:06", "what do i say. its a ring"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:06", ":("], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:10", "is that when u decided"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:12", "no. i decided when i went to the notice board on day three and the notice said 'reasons are the property of the state'. day nineteen was just when i could prove why it mattered"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:12", "i wrote it down that night. every line. dates. the three counts. who signed what. the school wall paper ran it in the spring. my teacher said i was fifteen and not allowed to publish the state"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:13", "and then u did"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:14", "the gaoling courier took me at seventeen as a copy runner. i wrote the lists story again properly. an editor read it and said 'do you know what you have here' and i said a ledger. he said no, a method. thats how i ended up at the chronicle"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:16", "and the thing u got wrong. the name"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:18", "2 years ago. i printed the name of a man who had survived in the hospitals ledger as dead. his daughter wrote to the desk. it ran as a correction on page 6. i walked to her house and said sorry in person. she shut the door. thats the one that taught me i get the facts right and the people wrong"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:19", "u told that to the captain too?"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:20", "yeah. he said take care and i said GL"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:21", "mina. u need to tell mom and dad ur ok. they think ur alone out there"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:22", "im not alone. i have the desk"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:22", "the desk is not a person"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:23", "taro is a person. most days"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:23", "LOL"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:25", "ok go to sleep. i love u. dont forget to eat"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:26", "ill call mom tomorrow. tell her i said hi"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:26", "ill tell her u said \"hi\" in ur little voice lol"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:27", "ill block you"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:27", "dont u dare"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:27", "joking. go to sleep"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 23:28", "night :)"]], "r": ["lol ok, text me the bread update when u hear", "tell ur mom bread is criminal", "ttyl"], "ar": true, "om": ""}, {"id": "hao", "n": "Jian Hao", "s": "off", "pm": "Si Wong garrison, liaison office", "h": [["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 19:12", "hao? the garrison switchboard says you transferred to the liaison office and gave me a number that rings out"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 19:12", "did something happen. do you want to talk about it?"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 19:13", "also are you ignoring me or did the relay in the basin die again"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 19:58", "i'm sorry"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 19:59", "sorry for what"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 19:59", "are you tired? did the posting go bad?"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:00", "really sorry"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:00", "ok im open. i trust you. just tell me what it is"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:02", "i blocked your line on the wire. thats why you got nothing"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:03", "wait. why"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:03", "????"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:05", "cuz i dont think we can keep being what we are"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:06", "what are we then"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:06", "like what do you mean, what is the reason"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:10", "theres nothing i want to talk about, i just wanted to say sorry"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:10", "thats all"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:11", "......"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:11", "really"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:11", "i thought it was something real"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:13", "dont mind it. sorry"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:14", "look. i trust you as you are. i just cant be convinced of anything when you wont say why"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:14", "why what"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:16", "forget it. i thought you had something to say. fine"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:16", "so you have no explanation, right? thats all i get"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:17", "i guess i get it if your colonel told you to cut contact with the press. ok. thanks"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:17", "just i thought it was something YOU wanted to say"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:21", "you know i cant"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:21", "nvm. thanks"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:22", "just say it"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:22", "thats all"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:22", "it was good knowing you"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:23", "you say it first"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:23", "no no"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:23", "the question is why you blocked me. and when did you decide to cut it off"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:24", "what do you think the reason is?"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:24", "assume it"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:25", "no. i mean it. why did you decide to block me"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:25", "is it the story?"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:27", "you know we cant keep going"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:27", "its obvious. ive been covering it for months and i cant anymore"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:27", "i dont feel ok talking to you like before"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:28", "thats the reason"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:29", "from our messages?"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:29", "ofc"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:29", "be honest. how am i"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:30", "im being honest"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:30", "no no. overall. how am i. like as a person"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:31", "youre a fucking idiot"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:31", "lol"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:32", "why are you so slow"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:32", "read it again"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:33", "i said i cant, because i actually like you. so i want to end it. its the best way i could think of"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:36", "i mean i have no feelings for you atm. i honestly just wanted us to stay friends and"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:37", "well i do"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:37", "thats why"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:38", "just unblock me"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:38", "why?"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:38", "just do it"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:38", "be honest"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:39", "dont interact with me then. thats all. im very honest. after this i wasnt going to message you again"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:40", "why would i unblock you. i dont want to see you"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:41", "then DONT follow each other. thats it"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:41", "WHY"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:41", "you fucking idiot"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:42", "oh for FUCKS sake"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:42", "let me be clear"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:42", "IF YOU WANT TO MOVE ON"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:42", "JUST MUTE ME"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:42", "AND KEEP THE LINE OPEN"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:43", "I WOULDNT MIND"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:44", "OH NO"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:44", "why would i unblock you lol"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:44", "if i cant see you and you cant see me thats a win for both right"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:45", "nah"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:46", "honestly i was going to leave it as it was and do my own work"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:46", "i was trying that. but you kept sending messages to the garrison"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:47", "AFTER THAT. i wasnt going back"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:47", "you really are a jerk"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:47", "thanks"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:48", "bruh"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:49", "better i found out now. i hoped it would end cleanly"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:50", "godammit. really"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:51", "you think this can be clean?"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:53", "i thought so. look. im just honest. im not like the others. i wouldnt mind you either"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:53", "same as everyone i knew before, thanks"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:54", "bruh"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:55", "to be clear i wont unblock you, and i wont go looking for you either"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:55", "just unblock me and i wont mind you"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:56", "live your life"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:56", "why. do you want to see my daily life?"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:56", "no"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:56", "be honest"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:57", "no, i dont. plus its better to unfollow each other, that part is true"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:57", "nah"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:58", "DO YOU THINK ID STALK YOU. fuck no"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:58", "fuck no. ewww. why would i think that"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 20:59", "exactly my point"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:00", "why would i unblock someone. why do you want me to. its better that you dont see me"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:01", "i thought i could trust you"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:01", "i thought so too"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:01", "ha. call me what you like"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:02", "im not calling you anything"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:04", "look. im a simple guy and i keep my agreements. thats all"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:08", "pfff"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:08", "im serious"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:09", "serious my ass. i gave you an honest answer and you still cant give me a real reason"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:10", "here is my reason"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:12", "i want it unblocked because its better to be transparent. if you had said unfollow me i WOULD have. i trust you with everything. ofc im an idiot"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:12", "and its better not to interact than to cut it like this. you dont burn the bridge"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:13", "you should have said that from the start, idiot"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:14", "its better to just GHOST than to do this ngl"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:14", "ghosting is my specialty"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:14", "EXACTLY"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:14", "welp"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:14", "THATS WHAT IM SAYING. GET IT NOW?"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:15", "no. sorry"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:16", "what else do i have to explain"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:18", "come on. you cant be serious. is it that hard to understand or do you need another long message"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:22", "is it really that hard to work out for yourself"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:23", "wdym"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 21:23", "just do your thing. forget the rest"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:01", "do you want to know why?"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:02", "yeah ofc"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:02", "why dont you think about it"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:03", "i cant stand people who wont explain. thats all"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:03", "you can work it out"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:03", "lol"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:04", "i hate that too lol"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:04", "this is what im saying. just what the fuck honestly"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:04", "that habit. exactly that"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:05", "wdym. like im not honest enough?"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:06", "im honest enough already. what do i need to explain. think it through. its simple"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:06", "pity whoever has to guess what you mean"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:08", "i hope the major treats you better"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:09", "lol im at my worst already. i really hate people right now"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:10", "you hate me too. ofc"], ["in", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:12", "take care"], ["out", "29 Oct 190 AG, 22:13", "thanks. up to you. jeez. GL"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 06:40", "im up. didnt sleep. your relay is still blocked so i am putting this here for the record. you said the major put you on the press desk. thats the reason. you cant be the reporters friend and the garrisons voice"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 06:41", "i get that. you could have just said it. that was my whole point"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:15", "that was half of it"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:15", "the other half i already said and you didnt like it"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:16", "i heard it"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:16", "i dont have that for you. i told you. i wont pretend"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:19", "i know. thats why im the one leaving, not you"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:19", "you dont really know what you want. i hate that"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:20", "i know exactly what i want. i want a reason when someone cuts me off. since i was fourteen"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:21", "zaofu"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:22", "zaofu"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:23", "you told me once at the camp. you said the lists changed three times in a week and nobody ever said why it was the housing blocks that were hit"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:24", "my grandmothers name was on none of them for two weeks. i read every list in the city hall. i was fourteen. rin was eight. she held my sleeve the whole night, thats how i got her out"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:25", "rin is the only one who knows the rest. thats why i became a reporter. so that no one gets to write \"reasons are the property of the state\" on a notice again and walk away"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:31", "i know"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:31", "im sorry. i should have given you mine"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:32", "yeah"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:32", "im sorry too. i tend to forget what i do to people. i get the facts right and the people wrong"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:40", "i forgive you. you dont have to say anything else"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:40", "i'll keep the wire closed. dont write to the garrison"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:41", "k"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:41", "i wont. i keep my word"], ["in", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:44", "take care mina"], ["out", "30 Oct 190 AG, 07:45", "you too. GL out there"]], "r": ["k", "not now", "...", "dont", "i said take care"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "grp", "n": "Night desk", "s": "on", "pm": "everyone is here (unfortunately)", "h": [["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:05", "ok everyone here? drill update. rigs 4 and 5 are down again", "p1"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:05", "lead is the drills. statement at 22:00 or we run without it", "p2"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:06", "WAIT korra just did something on the radio", "p3"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:06", "no. NOT now. we are at lead", "p2"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:07", "she told the council the fountain \"needed a hobby\" lol", "p3"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:07", "page 3. do not touch the lead"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:08", "can u not scare my mom with the drills thing", "p4"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:08", "no promises. the bandits left a note again", "p1"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 22:09", ":P"]], "r": ["ok ok", "one at a time pls", "who has the weather box?", "brb"], "ar": true, "om": "", "kw": [{"k": ["drill", "bandit", "rig"], "a": ["the drills thing again??", "i have 3 sources and 0 sleep", "bandits left a note. MARKER PEN."]}, {"k": ["korra"], "a": ["not now", "she is on page 3 and she knows it", "lol"]}], "g": 1, "mem": [{"id": "p1", "n": "Kaelen"}, {"id": "p2", "n": "Taro"}, {"id": "p3", "n": "Kanoikya"}, {"id": "p4", "n": "Rin"}]}, {"id": "xchieftak", "n": "Takeda [inkpot88]", "s": "off", "pm": "Chief editor, Gaozu", "h": [["in", "30 Sep 190 AG, 06:10", "landed?"], ["out", "30 Sep 190 AG, 06:44", "just now. republic city. it is raining sideways"], ["in", "30 Sep 190 AG, 06:45", "the summit starts tomorrow. your pass is at the hotel desk under the paper's name"], ["out", "30 Sep 190 AG, 06:45", "reasons for sending me and not foreign desk"], ["in", "30 Sep 190 AG, 06:46", "foreign desk covers the speeches. you cover what the speeches do to the price of bread"], ["out", "30 Sep 190 AG, 06:46", "so the economic story"], ["in", "30 Sep 190 AG, 06:47", "the economic story. nobody else will write it and everybody will read it"], ["out", "30 Sep 190 AG, 06:47", "k"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 19:20", "you are not filing today"], ["out", "2 Oct 190 AG, 19:21", "nothing to file. they only read statements"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 19:21", "good. do not file statements"], ["out", "2 Oct 190 AG, 19:22", "the oil people are already nervous in the lobby"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 19:22", "then that is your story. get names of the nervous ones"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 22:30", "closed. sanctions on the earth union and xinan. a call to stop fighting. and the wu merger is \"under way\""], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 22:31", "constitutional monarchy?"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 22:31", "yes"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 22:32", "that is the front page, not yours"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 22:32", "mine is monday. markets"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 22:33", "file it with the numbers from the exchange office and not from a broker who wants the price to move"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 22:33", "i know"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 22:34", "i know you know. i am saying it so i have said it"], ["in", "7 Oct 190 AG, 18:55", "filed and read. clean"], ["out", "7 Oct 190 AG, 18:56", "nothing to cut?"], ["in", "7 Oct 190 AG, 18:56", "one adjective. i took it out"], ["out", "7 Oct 190 AG, 18:57", "which"], ["in", "7 Oct 190 AG, 18:57", "\"alarming\""], ["out", "7 Oct 190 AG, 18:58", "fair. it was not alarming. it was expensive"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 08:02", "mina. my office. nine. bring the housing budget piece"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 08:03", "filed at six. its in the queue. what is wrong with it"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 08:03", "nothing is wrong with it. nine."], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 08:04", "k"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:41", "that was fast. i have a question you did not answer in my office"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:42", "which"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:42", "who gave you the committee numbers on the lower-district bread subsidy"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:43", "a clerk"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:43", "name"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:43", "no"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:44", "good. that is the right answer. i am asking so i know you will give me the same one if the legal desk asks"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:44", "i will"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:45", "i know. you always do. that is what makes you annoying"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 09:46", "ill take annoying"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:10", "pulled your qianchan piece from tomorrows page"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:11", "what"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:11", "why"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:12", "i will explain at six"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:12", "explain now"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:13", "mina"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:13", "i spent nine days on that. the three-count timeline. the ledger. you read it twice and said it was ready. you do not get to pull it and say six"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:15", "the legal desk flagged the second source. it is one person in the federal congress staff and they have not confirmed on the record"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:15", "he confirmed to me on the phone. i have my notes"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:16", "notes are not a confirmation. this is a paper not a diary. i am not killing it, i am holding it for 48 hours. get me the second name or a document"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:17", "thats the reason? thats all? you could have said that in the first message"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:17", "yes. i could have. i should have. that is my fault"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:18", "k. next time say the reason first. i work better knowing why"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:19", "noted. you are the only reporter i have who writes that in her contract"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:19", "i dont have it in my contract"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 14:19", "you should"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:30", "you are still here"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:31", "yeah. got a document from the congress registry. dated 14 oct. its the signed seat allocation"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:32", "you are better at ledgers than anyone i have hired in twenty years"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:32", "thank you"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:33", "you are also worse at people than anyone i have hired in twenty years"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:34", "i know"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:34", "i am not saying it to be cruel. the man you named wrongly two years ago, the correction on page six. i have never held that against you"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:35", "i hold it against me"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:36", "that is fine. just do not hold it so tight that you stop talking to people. sources are people. be warm. you can be warm and still not give them the name"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:37", "im warm"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:37", "you are polite. it is not the same"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:38", "k"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:38", "that \"k\" is exactly what i mean"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 19:39", "okay. i will try"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 07:05", "qianchan piece runs tomorrow. front of section b. well done"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 07:06", "thank you chief"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 07:06", "also kaelen wired the desert bureau. there may be another hit on the si wong rigs this week. if it flares it is yours. clear your friday"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 07:07", "my friday is clear. my friday has always been clear"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 07:07", "i know. that is a different conversation"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 07:08", "k"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 07:08", "mina."], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 07:08", "okay. noted. i will go home on friday"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xwenzhiyu", "n": "Zhiyuan [zy_ledger]", "s": "off", "pm": "Federal Congress registry clerk, Gaoling", "h": [["in", "3 Oct 190 AG, 09:15", "you are in republic city"], ["out", "3 Oct 190 AG, 09:16", "you saw the pass list"], ["in", "3 Oct 190 AG, 09:16", "the delegation list is not secret. you are on the paper's side"], ["out", "3 Oct 190 AG, 09:17", "i will need the tariff schedule for earth grain if it moves"], ["in", "3 Oct 190 AG, 09:18", "i can tell you which committee holds it"], ["out", "3 Oct 190 AG, 09:18", "that is enough"], ["in", "3 Oct 190 AG, 09:19", "committee on external trade. the clerk is mild and does not like to be asked twice"], ["out", "3 Oct 190 AG, 09:19", "i will ask once"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 20:42", "the summit statement says \"under way\" about the union"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 20:43", "you read it"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 20:43", "we read everything. the delegation says it is a statement, not a treaty"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 20:44", "that is the line i needed"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 20:44", "do not put my name on it"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 20:45", "it is not on it"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:10", "you said you would not use my name"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:11", "i wont. you are \"a congress staff member\". that is all"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:11", "and the date of the seat allocation"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:12", "i will not print the date unless you give me the ok"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:12", "ok. then i will tell you what is in it. but first why do you want the allocation. the results are public"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:13", "the results are public. the committee numbers behind the coalition are not. 124 seats for the Cheongbyeong Union and 118 for the Daiwa Party. i want to know who actually signed the coalition paper and when"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:15", "the Cheongbyeong, the Saebyeok and the Tianyuan signed on 11 oct. you know that"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:15", "i know the signing. i dont know the clause that gives the Tianyuan the agriculture ministry and the grain board together"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:17", "...how do you know that"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:17", "i dont. i asked. you just told me"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:18", "you are a terrible person"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:18", "i am a patient person"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:20", "it is in annex c. i will not send it. you will have to ask the president's office for it and they will say no"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:21", "then say yes to one thing. is annex c dated before or after the vote"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:23", "before"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:23", "k. thats enough for the second source. thank you"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:24", "dont thank me. im scared"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:25", "i know. i wont use your name. i keep my word"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:26", "my mother says you reporters eat people"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 21:26", "some of us eat dinner first"], ["in", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:03", "my section head asked who had been in the registry after hours"], ["out", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:03", "what did you say"], ["in", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:04", "that i was working on the seat tables for the house of qin petition"], ["out", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:04", "the house of qin does not petition"], ["in", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:05", "i know. i had to say something"], ["out", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:06", "it was a good lie. that house refuses everything, so nobody checks"], ["in", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:07", "is it wrong that i am proud of it"], ["out", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:07", "little bit"], ["in", "17 Oct 190 AG, 08:08", "ok"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:44", "i read your piece. second page of section b"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:45", "it is not out yet. how do you have it"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:45", "the chronicle sent proofs to the congress press office at five. i am the one who opens the press office mail"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:46", "of course you are"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:47", "you were fair to the Wangshi. you said they hold twelve seats and that the house of qin has refused them every time. that was correct. most reporters make it sound like the Qin are secretly waiting"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:48", "they arent waiting. i read their petition replies. all four were one line. \"the house wants nothing from the state\""], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:49", "that line is real. the head of the house says it to every journalist. it is also a very good way of saying something without saying it"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:50", "what is it saying"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:50", "that if the state offers, the state will need to say why. and nobody wants to say why"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:51", "that is the best thing anyone has told me this month"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:51", "dont use it"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:52", "i wont. i will remember it"], ["in", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:52", "that is worse"], ["out", "23 Oct 190 AG, 18:53", "GL with your section head"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xpaksunhe", "n": "Sunhee [yudao_dust]", "s": "off", "pm": "Archivist, Yu Dao municipal archive", "h": [["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:02", "Ms. Mina, the box you asked about has been found. permit files, 116 to 118 AG, port authority. it was in the cellar under the customs ledgers"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:03", "thank you pak. is it complete"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:04", "no. someone took the third folder in 119. the signature card says \"borrowed by the commission\". the commission has been dissolved since 121"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:05", "so nobody can return it"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:05", "that is the problem with a commission. it can borrow, but it cannot be asked"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:07", "k. what is in the other folders"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:08", "dock numbers. berth leases. a list of eleven names that appear on four hundred and six permits. one of the names is later a councillor"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:08", "which name"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:09", "i will not say it by message. come to the reading room. you may read, not copy"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:10", "i dont need to copy. i need to read it once"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:10", "that is what the last journalist said, in 163. she read it for four days"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:11", "i will take three"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 10:11", "ha"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:35", "you were in the reading room until closing. the guard says you did not look up once"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:36", "sorry. is that rude"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:36", "no. it is the first time in twenty years someone has read the permit files as if they mattered"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:38", "they matter. you can see the whole system in it. the permits are the patronage. the reform of 118 is the first page of a new book"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:39", "you sound like my teacher"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:39", "who was your teacher"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:40", "Sun Yifan. the prosecutor. she taught law at the harbor school before they took her off the bench. she used to say that every ledger is an argument. you only have to find who is arguing"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:41", "do you still have her notes"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:42", "a box. but that is not for a newspaper"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:42", "it isnt for a newspaper. i want to know what she thought. not what she proved"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:44", "come back on saturday. and bring tea. the reading room is cold"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 17:44", "i will bring two"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 08:20", "there is an old woman here asking about the Tidewater monument at Tsuruuo. she says her grandfather's name is on it"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 08:21", "can i speak to her"], ["in", "24 Oct 190 AG, 08:21", "she says she does not talk to newspapers. she talks to people. i said you are people"], ["out", "24 Oct 190 AG, 08:22", "thats the nicest thing anyone has called me this week"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xtomasrey", "n": "Taewon [tae_scoop]", "s": "off", "pm": "Reporter, the Republican Daily (rival)", "h": [["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 12:40", "you are on the press bench row nine. i checked"], ["out", "2 Oct 190 AG, 12:41", "why were you checking"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 12:41", "professional curiosity. republican daily has row two"], ["out", "2 Oct 190 AG, 12:42", "of course it does"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 12:42", "the foreign editor got the wire. i got the corridor"], ["out", "2 Oct 190 AG, 12:43", "so you are standing in a corridor all week"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 12:43", "yes. best view in the building"], ["in", "4 Oct 190 AG, 21:05", "you saw the xinan envoy leave the hall"], ["out", "4 Oct 190 AG, 21:06", "i saw him leave"], ["in", "4 Oct 190 AG, 21:06", "the dominion will say they walked out in protest"], ["out", "4 Oct 190 AG, 21:07", "did he"], ["in", "4 Oct 190 AG, 21:07", "his aide told me he had a stomach"], ["out", "4 Oct 190 AG, 21:08", "i do not print stomachs"], ["in", "4 Oct 190 AG, 21:08", "neither do i. it is going in a side box"], ["out", "4 Oct 190 AG, 21:09", "you are impossible"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 23:15", "you printing the price drop"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 23:16", "it is not a drop yet. markets open monday"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 23:17", "and then"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 23:17", "and then i will tell you when i print it"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 23:18", "cold"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 23:18", "reporters"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:14", "so you have the oil piece for tomorrow, or are you going to take another day to find a source with three degrees"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:14", "i have it"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:15", "of course you do"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:15", "do you have yours"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:16", "i have a photograph of a green smoke cloud over a rig with a very handsome sunrise behind it"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:16", "that is a postcard"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:17", "it is a front page postcard"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:18", "i bet you a dinner the chronicle runs the toll. the sand in the generators and the painted threat. yours has none of it"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:19", "i do not bet with the one reporter in the republic who reads the invoices"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:20", "i read the invoices because nobody else will"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:21", "and that is why you will be eating alone when you win the bet"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:22", "ill eat noodles. they are fine alone"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 22:22", "monster"], ["in", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:40", "hey. serious question. did your desk get the federal grain board memo"], ["out", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:41", "why"], ["in", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:41", "because ours did and the numbers do not match the last quarterly. there is a 12 percent hole in the import tonnage"], ["out", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:42", "you are asking me for a source"], ["in", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:42", "i am asking if you are looking at the same hole"], ["out", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:43", "yes. and i will not tell you what i found. you did not ask politely"], ["in", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:43", "i asked politely"], ["out", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:44", "you asked like a man who wants me to do his work"], ["in", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:44", "i asked like a man who is tired"], ["out", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:45", "...fair. i am looking at the border crossing logs, not the memo. the tonnage hole is at the crossing, not at the board"], ["in", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:46", "that is two days of work you just handed me"], ["out", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:46", "it is. keep my name out of it"], ["in", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:47", "you are a dangerous person to be friends with"], ["out", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:47", "im not your friend. im a reporter who does not like wasting a good lead"], ["in", "19 Oct 190 AG, 11:48", "that is exactly what a friend says"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 20:55", "i saw the draft of your qianchan piece on the chronicle internal sheet. someone left a tab open"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 20:56", "and"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 20:56", "and it is the best thing i have read this year. i hate you. is there a place where i can hate you quietly"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 20:57", "dinner on thursday"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 20:57", "you said you were eating alone"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 20:58", "the bet. you owe me a dinner"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 20:58", "i never took the bet"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 20:59", "you did. you said i would eat alone when i win. i won. you pay"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 21:00", "ok. thursday. noodles. i hate you"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 21:00", "GL finding a seat"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xmom", "n": "Mom", "s": "off", "pm": "home, Gaoling lower districts", "h": [["in", "1 Oct 190 AG, 07:30", "are you eating over there"], ["out", "1 Oct 190 AG, 07:31", "yes mom"], ["in", "1 Oct 190 AG, 07:31", "what"], ["out", "1 Oct 190 AG, 07:32", "rice and fish. the hotel does a set"], ["in", "1 Oct 190 AG, 07:32", "is it expensive"], ["out", "1 Oct 190 AG, 07:33", "the paper pays"], ["in", "1 Oct 190 AG, 07:33", "good. do not tell your father the price of the plane"], ["out", "1 Oct 190 AG, 07:34", "i will not"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 20:00", "the stall heard the news. the grain man says prices will go up"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 20:01", "it is not certain"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 20:01", "he says it is certain"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 20:02", "i will write what is certain. i will call you when i know"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 20:02", "you are on the radio at six"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 20:03", "i am not on the radio mom"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:02", "mina did you eat"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:04", "yes mom"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:04", "what did you eat"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:05", "noodles"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:05", "again"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:06", "they are good noodles"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:06", "the lowmarket stall sold the last loaf at a copper piece more today. your father says he will drive the grain truck to the river dock himself if they do it again"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:08", "i read the notice. it was the board, not the bakers"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:08", "i told your sister it was the bakers"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:09", "rin said. she told me you almost cried at the market"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:10", "i did not cry. i was angry in a wet way"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:10", "mom"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:11", "the old people at the stall did not say anything. they just paid. that is what made me angry"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:12", "that is what makes me angry too"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:13", "you get it from me"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:13", "i get it from dad"], ["in", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:14", "i will tell him you said that"], ["out", "10 Oct 190 AG, 18:14", "dont"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:30", "are you coming for the festival lanterns on sunday"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:31", "i have the oil story. i cant yet"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:31", "you said that about the harvest festival"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:32", "i know"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:32", "you said it about po po's day too"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:33", "mom"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:34", "it is fine. i light two lanterns. one for you. you do not have to be there for it to be yours"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:35", "i will try. i will actually try"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:35", "you always say that and then you try"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:36", "ok"], ["in", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:36", "eat something with a vegetable in it"], ["out", "18 Oct 190 AG, 19:37", "yes mom"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:15", "your sister told me you were blocked by a boy"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 08:15", "she is not supposed to tell you"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:16", "she tells me everything. that is her job. what happened"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:17", "nothing. he had his reasons. he told me. we are fine. we are not friends"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:17", "you are being very calm"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:18", "i am calm"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:18", "it is how you were in zaofu"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:19", "mom"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:19", "i am only saying. when you are calm like that, something is happening under it"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:20", "i know"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 08:20", "come home when you can. your father misses you. he will not say it. he will clean the truck"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xdad", "n": "Dad", "s": "off", "pm": "home, Gaoling", "h": [["in", "11 Oct 190 AG, 05:40", "on the road. dock by seven"], ["out", "11 Oct 190 AG, 05:41", "be careful dad"], ["in", "11 Oct 190 AG, 05:41", "rain on the river road. nothing new"], ["out", "11 Oct 190 AG, 05:42", "send a photo when you are there"], ["in", "11 Oct 190 AG, 05:42", "for what"], ["out", "11 Oct 190 AG, 05:43", "because i like to know you got there"], ["in", "11 Oct 190 AG, 05:43", "ok"], ["in", "11 Oct 190 AG, 07:10", "[photo of a grain barge in fog]"], ["out", "11 Oct 190 AG, 07:10", "thank you. it is a nice barge"], ["in", "11 Oct 190 AG, 07:11", "it is a barge"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 21:20", "your mother says you are not coming sunday"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 21:21", "i might. i have a story"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:21", "i know. i read your paper"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:22", "you read the chronicle"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:22", "i buy it at the dock kiosk. the man gives me a discount when i say my daughter writes in it"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:23", "dad"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:23", "it is a good discount"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:24", "you could just tell me you are proud"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:24", "i am not proud. i am relieved"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:25", "why relieved"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:25", "because you can say a thing out loud. i drove nine hours to reach you in zaofu and you were sitting in a shed with a list in your head. i could not do anything. now you do something with it"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:27", "you could do something. you drove nine hours"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:27", "that is not doing something. that is arriving late"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:28", "you arrived"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:28", "ok"], ["out", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:29", "i will come sunday"], ["in", "21 Oct 190 AG, 21:29", "i will clean the truck"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xmrsoyama", "n": "Oyama-san [oyama_cats]", "s": "off", "pm": "landlady, Republic City", "h": [["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 07:30", "miss mina the hallway light is out again"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 07:31", "i will tell the maintenance man"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 07:31", "i have told him. he said it is the wiring. i said it is his hands"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 07:32", "lol"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 07:32", "also your rent is on time again. i am suspicious"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 07:33", "i dont like owing people"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 07:33", "you are the first tenant i have had who apologizes for a late tram"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 23:50", "miss mina you came in at midnight with three notebooks again"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 23:51", "sorry. i was at the archive"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 23:51", "there is soup on the stove. i will not say it is for you. it is for the stairwell"], ["out", "22 Oct 190 AG, 23:52", "thank you mrs oyama"], ["in", "22 Oct 190 AG, 23:52", "do not thank soup. eat it"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:45", "a man in a uniform left a letter at the door. he did not want to give it to me. i said you are not here"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:46", "what kind of uniform"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:47", "the green of the garrison. a captain. he looked like he had not slept. he said to tell you it was not an apology"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:47", "put it on the table. i will read it tonight"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:48", "he stood there for ten minutes after"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:48", "ok"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:49", "miss mina. be kind"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:49", "i am always kind"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 07:50", "you are always polite. it is different. eat the soup"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xchunhei", "n": "Chun [chunbolt99]", "s": "off", "pm": "Academy of Gaoling classmate, now an engineer in Qianchan", "h": [["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:00", "mina!! are you alive"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:01", "yes. hi"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:01", "i saw your name in the byline of the grain story. you got a column"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:02", "i got a page. column is a promotion"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:02", "you were always going to get one. you were the one writing the wall paper about the cafeteria prices"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:03", "that was a very important story"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:03", "it fixed the prices"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:04", "it fixed the rice. the soup stayed bad"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:05", "ok serious. i work for the coal engine works now. the old monuments by the academy. they gave us a contract to restore the third engine and you will not believe what was in the boiler"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:06", "what was in the boiler"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:07", "a ledger book. fireproofed in a tin. from 120 BG. the old council of elders' stores"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:08", "send me a photo"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:08", "you are the only person who would ask for the ledger and not the engine"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:09", "the engine is a machine. the ledger is a decision"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:10", "i think about that line every day"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:11", "i stole it from a clerk"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:12", "photo coming"], ["in", "15 Oct 190 AG, 21:15", "also did you ever find out what happened to professor yang"], ["out", "15 Oct 190 AG, 21:16", "he retired. he lives near the lake in the hills. he sends me a postcard every new year"], ["in", "15 Oct 190 AG, 21:16", "he failed me twice"], ["out", "15 Oct 190 AG, 21:17", "he passed me once and then asked why i wrote in the margins"], ["in", "15 Oct 190 AG, 21:17", "what did you write"], ["out", "15 Oct 190 AG, 21:18", "\"why\""], ["in", "15 Oct 190 AG, 21:18", "classic"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:30", "rin messaged me. she said you got dumped by some desert captain"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:31", "i was blocked, not dumped. and nobody dumped anyone. he had a reason and he gave it"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:32", "are you okay"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:32", "i am fine"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:33", "you say \"fine\" the way professor yang said \"interesting\""], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:33", "rin talks too much"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:34", "she loves you. come visit. i will show you the third engine. it is only slightly haunted"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:35", "ok. when the oil story calms down"], ["in", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:35", "it will not calm down"], ["out", "31 Oct 190 AG, 22:36", "you are probably right"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xltaokida", "n": "Aoki [aoki_navy]", "s": "off", "pm": "Imperial-era records office, now an officer in the Qinglan Port authority", "h": [["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:05", "Ms. Mina. I got your request for the berth logs"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:06", "yes. 99 and 100 AG, the arsenal weeks"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:06", "those are not public"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:07", "they are in the archive index as \"restricted pending review\". the review was due in 160"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:08", "you read the index"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:08", "i read everything. that is the job"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:09", "I will say this once. the review did not happen because nobody asked to be responsible for it"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:10", "then i am asking. in writing, today"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:10", "you will put my name on a letter"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:11", "i will put the port authority's name on it. i will not put yours unless you say so"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:12", "...that is better than I expected"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:12", "i do not use people"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:13", "you are a journalist"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:13", "and i do not use people"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:15", "send the letter. I will make sure it lands on a desk that has to answer"], ["out", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:15", "thank you"], ["in", "25 Oct 190 AG, 10:16", "do not thank me. nothing has happened yet"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xdrhanmei", "n": "Dr. Han [meilin_md]", "s": "off", "pm": "Gaoling survivors' clinic, doctor", "h": [["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:40", "dr han. i have the draft. may i read you the two paragraphs about the clinic"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:41", "read them"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:43", "(sends two paragraphs)"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:46", "the second one says \"waiting list\". we do not call it that"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:46", "what do you call it"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:47", "\"the order we can see people\". it is not a list. people are not waiting, they are being seen in the order we can manage"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:48", "that is more accurate and much longer"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:48", "it is more accurate"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:49", "i will use it"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:50", "you are not going to argue"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:50", "you know what the word means to the people in it. i dont"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:52", "one more thing. your survivors from the 180 bombing. do not list ages"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:52", "why"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:53", "because a child who was eight and is now eighteen is going to read it and see their age next to the number"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:55", "yes. okay. i will cut them"], ["in", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:55", "thank you for asking before printing"], ["out", "26 Oct 190 AG, 16:56", "i learned that one the hard way"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xkenji", "n": "Kenji [snapkenji88]", "s": "off", "pm": "photographer, Gaozu", "h": [["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:30", "i am outside your building. you said 7"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:31", "i said 7:30"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:31", "no you said 7"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:32", "scroll up"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:32", "ok you said 7:30. i am early. coffee?"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:33", "coming down"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:50", "the district looks different from last time"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:51", "they put up the notice board again"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:51", "can i photograph it"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:52", "yes. get the line at the bottom"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:52", "\"reasons are the property of the state\""], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:52", "that one"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:53", "you want the people reading it too?"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:53", "no faces. just hands, feet. the way they stand"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:54", "you are directing me now"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:54", "sorry"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 07:55", "no. keep going. it is better your way"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xmsvega", "n": "Ms. Wei [weiwords]", "s": "off", "pm": "legal desk, Gaozu", "h": [["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:00", "Mina. the Qianchan piece. I need the second source in writing by Thursday"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:01", "he will not write"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:01", "then a recorded call, with consent on the recording"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:02", "he said he would never be recorded"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:03", "then we are where we were. one anonymous source and notes"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:04", "you are not going to let it run"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:04", "I am going to let it run when it is safe. that is the whole job"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:06", "what if i find the document that backs him"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:06", "then you do not need him on the record"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:07", "the ledger. the committee papers. i think pak has it"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:08", "then ask pak. and Mina"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:08", "what"], ["in", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:09", "you are right about the story. I think you are right. I need it clean, so no one can say you were not"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:10", "k"], ["out", "27 Oct 190 AG, 15:10", "thank you for the reason"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "xauntielo", "n": "Auntie Lo [lo_soup]", "s": "off", "pm": "Po Po's old neighbor, Gaoling lower districts", "h": [["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:20", "mina. you are on the news"], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:21", "i am not on the news. my byline is"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:22", "same thing. i am proud. your Po Po would be loud about it"], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:23", "she would have cut it out and put it in the tin"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:23", "she did. i have the tin"], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:24", "you have the tin?"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:24", "when they cleared the room. i took it. i was going to wait until you were ready"], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:25", "auntie"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:25", "there are clippings. there is a spoon. there is your sister's drawing"], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:27", "can i come saturday"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:27", "i will make the soup"], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:28", "ok. ok. i will come"], ["in", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:28", "bring Rin"], ["out", "28 Oct 190 AG, 18:29", "i will"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting, will reply later", "ok", "one sec"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "yodessabr", "n": "Ayumi [ayu_prices]", "s": "off", "pm": "Republic City Exchange Office, press clerk (Mina's price sou", "h": [["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 08:20", "Ms. Mikanazu. you asked for the opening prints"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 08:21", "yes. grain and crude. the first full day after the summit"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 08:22", "I can give you the public board. not the broker desk notes"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 08:22", "the public board is what i want"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 08:23", "good. most people ask for the notes and then print the rumor"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 08:24", "i print numbers with the office that gave them"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 08:24", "that is the nicest thing a reporter has said to me this year"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 11:50", "crude up four and falling. grain flat to soft. insurance quotes are on a separate sheet"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 11:51", "can i say \"provisional\" for the insurance"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 11:51", "please do"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 11:52", "k. thank you"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 11:52", "do not thank me. just do not make it a headline"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 11:53", "it will be page four"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "ysergeivo", "n": "Sung [sung_cargo]", "s": "off", "pm": "Marine underwriter, Harbor Ward", "h": [["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:10", "you called my office"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:11", "yes. insurance on earth union cargoes"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:11", "I will say a fifth. you may say \"about a fifth\""], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:12", "is that an estimate or a quote"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:12", "an estimate. the quotes change by the hour"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:13", "then i will say estimate and name you as a harbor ward underwriter"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:13", "unnamed"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:14", "unnamed. agreed"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:15", "you are the first reporter who did not argue"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:15", "i dont need your name. i need your reason"], ["in", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:16", "the reason is the sanctions bar the union from the clearing house. no clearing, no cheap cover"], ["out", "6 Oct 190 AG, 13:17", "that is all i needed"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "yaiderent", "n": "Tsubasa [tsu_aide]", "s": "off", "pm": "Qianchan delegation, press aide to Deputy Foreign Minister S", "h": [["in", "3 Oct 190 AG, 17:30", "Ms. Mina. the Deputy Minister can give you four minutes tomorrow, 9:15, corridor B"], ["out", "3 Oct 190 AG, 17:31", "on the record"], ["in", "3 Oct 190 AG, 17:31", "on the record. about the summit, not about the Earth lands"], ["out", "3 Oct 190 AG, 17:32", "then i will ask about the grain"], ["in", "3 Oct 190 AG, 17:32", "that is the Earth lands"], ["out", "3 Oct 190 AG, 17:33", "grain is a price, not a country"], ["in", "3 Oct 190 AG, 17:34", "I will tell her you said that"], ["out", "3 Oct 190 AG, 17:34", "do"], ["in", "4 Oct 190 AG, 09:40", "she said you may ask one question and she may answer a different one"], ["out", "4 Oct 190 AG, 09:41", "that is honest at least"], ["in", "4 Oct 190 AG, 09:41", "she liked you"], ["out", "4 Oct 190 AG, 09:42", "she answered a different question"], ["in", "4 Oct 190 AG, 09:42", "that is how you know"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "yyuki", "n": "Yuki [yukired]", "s": "off", "pm": "copy editor, Gaozu", "h": [["in", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:40", "your markets piece. \"slip\" or \"sag\" in the headline"], ["out", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:41", "slip. sag is a roof"], ["in", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:41", "slip it is"], ["in", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:42", "also you wrote \"Republic City Exchange\" in paragraph one and \"Exchange Office\" in four. which"], ["out", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:42", "the office reported the numbers. the exchange is the place"], ["in", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:43", "ok. I will leave both and add a line to the style sheet"], ["out", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:44", "thank you"], ["in", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:44", "you are the only reporter who answers my queries with reasons"], ["out", "7 Oct 190 AG, 17:45", "i like knowing why too"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "ymsphoebe", "n": "Ms. Lin [lin_gz_teach]", "s": "off", "pm": "Mina's old teacher, Academy of Gaoling", "h": [["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:05", "I saw your name in the paper. in republic city"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:06", "miss lin"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:06", "you were the girl who asked why on every test"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:07", "you let me"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:07", "I did. do not let anyone stop you"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:09", "i wont. how is the academy"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:10", "smaller. the old building is empty"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:10", "i could write about that"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:11", "do. we need it written"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 20:11", "ok. i will come in november"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "ysedna", "n": "Sedna", "s": "off", "pm": "Northern Water Tribe delegate, summit press office", "h": [["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 14:00", "you are not a foreign correspondent"], ["out", "2 Oct 190 AG, 14:01", "no. i do bread and oil"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 14:01", "good. the foreign ones ask me about leftists. you ask about prices"], ["out", "2 Oct 190 AG, 14:02", "do the northern guilds feel the sanctions"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 14:03", "ask me after. the guilds feel everything second"], ["out", "2 Oct 190 AG, 14:03", "second is still a story"], ["in", "2 Oct 190 AG, 14:04", "you are right. find me on the last day"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 18:10", "the guilds are worried about the oil price. the lamps in the north burn it"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 18:11", "may i use that"], ["in", "5 Oct 190 AG, 18:11", "use it as \"a northern delegate\". not my name"], ["out", "5 Oct 190 AG, 18:12", "k"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "zjihojiho", "n": "Jiho [jiho_dockhand]", "s": "off", "pm": "River-dock friend of Dad, Gaoling", "h": [["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 19:10", "mina. your dad told me you are famous"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 19:11", "he tells everyone that. i am not famous"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 19:11", "he says you wrote about bread"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 19:12", "i wrote about what bread costs. different"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 19:13", "the dock boys read it out loud at lunch. they argued for an hour"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 19:13", "about what"], ["in", "12 Oct 190 AG, 19:14", "whether you were right. you were"], ["out", "12 Oct 190 AG, 19:14", "k. tell them to read the footnote too"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "zmeimeime", "n": "Mei-Mei [meimei_pixel]", "s": "off", "pm": "Gaoling Academy friend, now at a print shop", "h": [["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 22:30", "MINA. print shop got the new type. your byline looks so GOOD in it"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 22:31", "you are printing me"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 22:31", "i am printing a proof of you. for the wall"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 22:32", "please dont put it on the wall"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 22:32", "too late"], ["out", "14 Oct 190 AG, 22:33", "ok. but only the markets piece"], ["in", "14 Oct 190 AG, 22:33", "deal. also come home. you are too thin in the wedding photo"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "zseoseo_o", "n": "Seo [seo_overtime]", "s": "off", "pm": "Reporter, Yu Dao desk (friendly rival)", "h": [["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 15:00", "heard you are chasing the berth logs"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 15:01", "where did you hear that"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 15:01", "port office is small and loud"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 15:02", "are you chasing them too"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 15:02", "no. i wrote the 100 AG one in school. i am done with ledgers"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 15:03", "coward"], ["in", "16 Oct 190 AG, 15:03", "survivor"], ["out", "16 Oct 190 AG, 15:04", "lol. ok. thanks for not racing me"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "zrenjiren", "n": "Ren-ji [renji_bbs]", "s": "off", "pm": "Message board mod, the Gaozu forum", "h": [["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 23:50", "ur markets piece is on the front of the forum"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 23:51", "is it"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 23:51", "23 comments. 22 argue about oil. 1 says nice font"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 23:52", "the one about the font is the only one i trust"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 23:52", "lol"], ["in", "20 Oct 190 AG, 23:53", "do u want the oil ones deleted"], ["out", "20 Oct 190 AG, 23:53", "no. leave them. people are entitled to be wrong in public"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}, {"id": "zakaneaka", "n": "Akane [akane_wire]", "s": "off", "pm": "Wire clerk, Tajisaki bureau", "h": [["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 04:20", "mina. forwarding the palace reaction on the summit"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 04:21", "thank you. is it the long one"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 04:21", "the long one. it says nothing in 900 words"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 04:22", "i will print the first sentence"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 04:22", "the first sentence says nothing too"], ["out", "9 Oct 190 AG, 04:23", "i know. i will print it and let people see"], ["in", "9 Oct 190 AG, 04:23", "that is a policy"]], "r": ["k", "in a meeting", "one sec", "ok"], "ar": false, "om": ""}]};
